# Vulnerabilities the image scan (.github/actions/scan-image) should NOT fail on.
# One CVE id per line. Every entry needs a comment saying why it is safe to ignore and WHEN to remove it:
#
#   # CVE-2099-12345: only reachable through <x>, which this image does not use. Re-check <date>.
#   CVE-2099-12345
#
# The scan already skips vulnerabilities that have no fix yet (ignore-unfixed), so this file should stay short.
